invisibility
or teleportation, I zap myself with it to see which it is ... nothing
happens..
and then I notice my armor class has gone up 5 points! That's right,
 neighbors, I zapped myself with a WAND OF CANCELLATION!  Arrrgghh!
All enchantments of magic items go away.  But on the plus side,
everything I was still carrying from the bones got uncursed too,
so it wasn't a total loss.

